3) Regime (VIX) versions — optional but powerful

Fit two vines: low-VIX vs high-VIX. You’ll see tail parameters strengthen in high VIX.

low_mask  = (vix <= 20)
high_mask = (vix >= 25)

vine_low  = pv.Vinecop(U[low_mask],  controls)
vine_high = pv.Vinecop(U[high_mask], controls)

print("LOW regime");  print(vine_low)
print("HIGH regime"); print(vine_high)

# Compare tail stats per regime
_ = tail_stats(U[low_mask],  vine_low)
_ = tail_stats(U[high_mask], vine_high)


