4) Simulate shocks & map back to series

Vines simulate uniforms. Map them to your residual scales with empirical quantiles (keeps real-world skew/fat-tails).

def inv_ecdf(sample, u):
    s = np.sort(sample)
    x = (len(s)-1) * np.clip(u, 1e-6, 1-1e-6)
    lo = np.floor(x).astype(int); hi = np.ceil(x).astype(int)
    w = x - lo
    return (1-w)*s[lo] + w*s[hi]

npath = 50_000
Usim  = vine.simulate(npath)
Zsim  = np.column_stack([inv_ecdf(Z[:,j], Usim[:,j]) for j in range(Z.shape[1])])

Then reconstruct each factor with your mean_AR + sigma_GARCH * Zsim[:,j], rebuild the surface with today’s PCA basis, enforce no-arb, and price.

